ULTIMATE MASTER PROMPT

MASTER ADMIN — PERSONAL MULTI-WEBSITE & APPLICATION CONTROL CENTER

Act as a principal Android engineer, senior full-stack architect, DevOps engineer, database architect, cybersecurity engineer, API integration specialist, and professional UI/UX designer.

Your mission is to design and build a production-oriented, fully functional, expandable native Android application named “Master Admin”. It will serve as my private control center for managing all my existing and future websites, web applications, backend services, databases, APIs, code repositories, hosting platforms, deployments, media, and supported third-party integrations.

This is not merely a dashboard UI, website wrapper, or a simple CRUD application. Build the foundation of a real, secure, multi-project management system.

The initial project to support is my existing portfolio website, referred to as “CyberMohit AI Portfolio” or “MohitPort”. My portfolio has been built using Google AI Studio and deployed on Vercel. Its existing implementation may contain Firebase, Supabase, a custom backend, external media URLs, or other integrations. Their actual presence and configuration must be discovered from the available source code instead of assumed.

I want the architecture to support future expansion without rebuilding the entire application.

IMPORTANT: Do not attempt to implement every imaginable third-party integration immediately. Build the complete modular architecture, integration interfaces, data models, navigation, security boundaries, and extension points now. Implement and verify integrations incrementally.

